A `--config` path no tier declares exits 1 naming the path; the spec is resolved before any
vault is, so the global tier alone is enough to reach the error.

-- fixtures/xdg/booping/config.yaml --
core:
  probe_playbook:
    queries:
      done_plans:
        glob:
          - plans/*/index.md
-- cmd --
booping query --config core.probe_playbook.queries.nope
-- exit --
1
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
error: no query spec at config path: core.probe_playbook.queries.nope
